<title>USA: JB Oxford names Felix Oeri chairman.</title>
<headline>JB Oxford names Felix Oeri chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BEVERLY HILLS, Calif. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>JB Oxford Holdings Inc on Friday said it named Felix Oeri as chairman to succeed Stephen Rubenstein, who will remain as chief executive.</p>
<p>Oeri, chairman of Oeri Finance, is J.B. Oxford's largest shareholder and head of international brokerage operations for the company's JB Oxford &amp; Co subsidiary in Basel, Switzerland, the company said.</p>
<p>Rubenstein will serve as chief executive of JB Oxford Holdings under a new contract that runs through April 2000.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
